sentence_from_doc1:
S Onie 
reports grants or contracts from the Suicide Prevention Research Fund; 
Consulting fees from the World Health Organization Headquarters; 
Support for attending meetings and/or travel from the World 
Conference for Science Journalists and the Black Dog Institute; 
Leadership or fiduciary role in other board, society, committee or 
advocacy group paid or unpaid as the founding president of the 
Indonesian Association for Suicide Prevention, and as an elected 
national representative of the International Association for Suicide 
Prevention; Stock or stock options in Wellspring Clinic Indonesia; 
outside the submitted work.

